{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "0CHP", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-affine}"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:bd798c882d56fe1f4207c68dca442749767cb9458cc8067dc07464e3a39acf32", "source_text": "Affine morphisms", "source_text_hash": "sha256:809120492248df9bf87621b6d9bcab193f43e60b2b6ca7a80998d7fddf84b7f6", "unit_id": "tag:0CHP:title"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "0CHP", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8cdb9e5d7c47a6dd1ad7e81d7300c18299ddb5405870b2280d06db5d9d0ec521", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nAffine morphisms of algebraic stacks are defined as follows.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7ed7afc31a9c6d42e29f58219e14f34037f9f9436e1097d5266d1e28d2fa6b37", "unit_id": "tag:0CHP:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "0CHP", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{stacks-properties-section-properties-morphisms}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-affine}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:27692f0ee7f2b4c09456523aa22c05c621b7719a72cc44798bbb3fcb07b9fbc8", "source_text": "A morphism of algebraic stacks is said to be <TEXTITOPEN_0001>affine<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>\nif it is representable and affine in the sense of\nProperties of Stacks, Section\n<REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b860d31efe014a26f270cb4527b65e77302062ed08d92d811812f7df7746b3ab", "unit_id": "tag:0CHQ:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "0CHP", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{stacks-properties-section-properties-morphisms}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5089ebcda2885669bf2092bf4879eb884eb7948d181ab39a90f1ab7b66ab123f", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nFor us it is a little bit more convenient to think of an affine\nmorphism of algebraic stacks as a morphism of algebraic stacks which is\nrepresentable by algebraic spaces and affine in the sense of\nProperties of Stacks, Section\n<REF_0001>.\n(Recall that the default for ``representable'' in the Stacks project\nis representable by schemes.)\nSince this is clearly equivalent to the notion just defined we shall\nuse this characterization without further mention.\nWe prove a few simple lemmas about this notion.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7fc0fd744461d6e0e8bb8973bd8127a726ac753e02c63a28eea3b80344d7cfe3", "unit_id": "tag:0CHP:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0CHP", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{X}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-affine}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:7a7cf25a2fc50f8d8ad17c552b076ee86b97b5f0d2d2b7155de6c7482cb00c00", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a40dcfe9f1533c8cb3d77b28d73f5e5a6162bb53924d03508037cdb2051067ae", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nLet <MATH_0002> be an affine morphism of algebraic\nstacks. Then <MATH_0003>\nis an affine morphism of algebraic stacks.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:20a3fbe39c5fb134a18108dd6ebb801f096a368d1de6391643b1884c003da209", "unit_id": "tag:0CHR:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0CHP", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{stacks-properties-section-properties-morphisms}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:2232579a8d0fb77c4b78dcf1db8c80dea0f4ea1dd4744048905d7a63be048b9b", "source_text": "This follows from the discussion in\nProperties of Stacks, Section\n<REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0d019b60c74f985bb296798fcb1e39811a8a5bee62cacf161c967c2af31b457e", "unit_id": "tag:0CHR:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0CHP", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-composition-affine}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3efdff465e9d8d97f82a7914ba31c8a98421afcb75765795ee8ca77401c9b93c", "source_text": "Compositions of affine morphisms of algebraic stacks are affine.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:24cd3755a811a6d6472b2f3cab486908e343a1c0ae57cca94433c105ee3841cd", "unit_id": "tag:0CHS:statement"}
